    "scope": "Owner-approved specification 0.3 supports Linux x86_64 and Windows x86_64 on CPython 3.11-3.14 (8 cells); macOS remains unsupported and unqualified. Current MI-08 matrix evidence has been refreshed and independently aggregated; full M3 gate qualification is still pending.",
